<title>POLAND: Stomil Sanok up 120 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Stomil Sanok up 120 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish rubber producer Stomil Sanok SA started trading on the main market of the Warsaw bourse at 55 zlotys, 120 percent above its initial public offering price of 25 zlotys.</p>
<p>Sanok's 500,000-share IPO in November 1996 was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
